        "Todd Bienvenu",
        "Last name: Bienvenu"
      ],
      "excerpt": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-small\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Born in 1980 in Little Rock, Arkansas.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" class=\"sqsrte-small\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lives and works in New York, USA.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Todd Bienvenu’s thick oil and acrylic paintings are expressive, resplendent and uninhibited, driven by&nbsp;strong color and spontaneous movement. He&nbsp;applies paint directly as&nbsp;forms and subjects emerge through addition and subtraction. Burlesque scenes – parties, beaches, sex, alcohol – carry an&nbsp;underlying melancholy, touching on&nbsp;time, solitude, and the body’s vulnerability.</p>",
      "location": {
        "mapZoom": 12,
        "mapLat": 40.7207559,
        "mapLng": -74.0007613,
